(* Variant control-node-none: the control stream of a C node to the controller (AUD-5, #389; AUD-6, #409; Control.c,
   ControlRun, on the TLS transport of NodeControllerTls), against an attacker that is the network and nothing more. The
   node is alice and the controller is bob. The node checks the certificate of the controller against the TLS
   fingerprint of its Controller settings (NodeControllerVerify), and its Noise_IK handshake with the static key of the
   controller is bound to the exporter of CONTROL_EXPORTER_LABEL. It sends its Hello and a lease, no password, and the
   controller takes the static key as the node. *)

process
  ( Setup()
  | ControlSessions(pin_on, lab_exp_control)
  )
